    "upstream_operation": "KDF (SP 800-108r1) AFT: keyIn (+ iv for feedback) -> fixedData, keyOut",
    "local_operation": "C_CreateObject(base key: CKK_AES for CMAC, CKK_GENERIC_SECRET for HMAC; CKA_DERIVE, CKA_VALUE = keyIn) then C_DeriveKey(CKM_SP800_108_COUNTER_KDF / _FEEDBACK_KDF / _DOUBLE_PIPELINE_KDF) with prfType = CKM_<hash>_HMAC or CKM_AES_CMAC and CK_PRF_DATA_PARAM segments laid out per counterLocation: ITERATION_VARIABLE (counter mode: CK_SP800_108_COUNTER_FORMAT big-endian, counterLength bits; feedback / double pipeline: NULL, the K(i-1) / A(i) chaining value), COUNTER where the upstream places it, BYTE_ARRAY = fixedData (split at breakLocation for \"middle\"); feedback IV = upstream iv; CKA_VALUE_LEN = keyOutLength/8; output byte-compared to keyOut",
    "transformation": "subset only; every retained field is byte-copied from the upstream file (hex case preserved); no value is re-derived",
    "subset_policy": "Deterministic, keyOutLength = 1024 bits (multi-block) groups (for \"middle fixed data\", when no 1024-bit group has a byte-aligned breakLocation, the lowest-tgId byte-aligned-output group that has one). (a) Every kdfMode (counter, feedback, double pipeline iteration) x every macMode with a PKCS#11 v3.2 Table 196 PRF (CMAC-AES128/192/256, HMAC-SHA-1, SHA2-224/256/384/512, SHA3-224/256/384/512) at counterLocation \"before fixed data\", 32-bit counter. (b) For HMAC-SHA2-256 and CMAC-AES128 only: every other counterLocation of each mode (32-bit counter; none for \"none\"), an 8-bit counter in counter mode, and a zero-length IV in feedback mode. Within a group the lowest tcId (for \"middle fixed data\" the lowest tcId with a byte-aligned breakLocation). Not used: CMAC-TDES and HMAC-SHA2-512/224, /256 (not in PKCS#11 v3.2 Table 196), bit-oriented output lengths, the remaining groups.",
    "retained_fields": "tcId, keyIn, fixedData, keyOut, iv (feedback), breakLocation (middle fixed data) — deferred, l and unused fields dropped",
    "construction_note": "The data-parameter layouts were checked with an independent SP 800-108 implementation (Python hmac/cryptography CMAC) against every byte-aligned upstream case of the executed macModes (4680 cases, all reproduced; double pipeline A(0) = fixedData) before the subset was cut."
  },
